IMPORT policy

-- Standing preamble (applies to every query below): assume all conditions
-- not mentioned in the specific query are met and no exclusion not
-- mentioned applies; the agreement has been signed and the premium has
-- been paid on time.

-- Q1: hospitalized by burns suffered while doing my duty as a firefighter.
-- Firefighting is an excluded cause (policy S2.1.3) regardless of any other
-- condition being met.
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 3
    `hospitalization ground`                     IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`                     IS 40
    `causes`                                     IS LIST Firefighting
    `fraud month`                                IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`                    IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`                       IS JUST 1
    `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`                 IS JUST 1
    `dispute arisen`                             IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`                     IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`                IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`             IS FALSE
    `written proof of claim month`               IS JUST 1
    `recovery sought month`                      IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                         IS 12

#EVAL covered q1

