-- Q4: hospitalized due to a fall while traveling abroad; confirmation of
-- the wellness visit was given 8 months after the effective date -- after
-- the 7-month deadline in S1.3. Hospitalization is placed after that
-- deadline (month 9) so the "still pending" escape does not apply and the
-- late confirmation is squarely tested. Worldwide travel is not a ground
-- for exclusion (S3.1.1).
q4 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 9
    `hospitalization ground`                     IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`                     IS 45
    `causes`                                     IS EMPTY
    `fraud month`                                IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`                    IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`                       IS JUST 1
    `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`                 IS JUST 8
    `dispute arisen`                             IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`                     IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`                IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`             IS FALSE
    `written proof of claim month`               IS JUST 1
    `recovery sought month`                      IS NOTHING
    `policy term months`                         IS 12

#EVAL covered q4

-- Q5: hospitalized for punching my own face to show off for my friends; no
